From: OpenWrt WR840N V6.2 XMC build kit
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: add XMC XM25QH32D support

The XMC XM25QH32D is a 32-Mbit (4-MiB) SPI NOR device. Its JEDEC ID is
0x204016. The datasheet specifies 4-KiB sector erase (opcode 0x20).

Add the device using the standard SPI-NOR read/program/erase operations.
No dual/quad mode is enabled in this initial compatibility patch.

--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/spi-nor.c
@@ -500,4 +500,7 @@
 /* ESMT */
 { "f25l32pa", INFO(0x8c2016, 0, 64 * 1024, 64, SECT_4K) },
 
+/* XMC */
+{ "xm25qh32d", INFO(0x204016, 0, 64 * 1024, 64, SECT_4K) },
+
 /* Everspin */
